istani must be in position 2.\n\nSo:\n- Position 1: Job = videographer\n- Position 2: Movie = animation, Nationality = Pakistani\n\nNow, since each attribute has unique values:\n\nJobs: videographer (pos1), so position 2 must be freelancer.\n\nMovie genres: animation (pos2), so position 1 must be thriller.\n\nNationalities: Pakistani (pos2), so position 1 must be Nigerian.\n\nLet’s write it out:\n\n**Position 1:**\n- Job: videographer\n- Movie: thriller (only one left)\n- Nationality: Nigerian (only one left)\n\n**Position 2:**\n- Job: freelancer (only one left)\n- Movie: animation\n- Nationality: Pakistani\n\nNow, check constraints:\n\n1. Pakistani (pos2) is adjacent to videographer (pos1) → yes, they are next to each other → ✅\n\n2. Videographer (pos1) is to the left of animation watcher (pos2) → yes → ✅\n\nAll attributes are uniquely assigned → ✅\n\nNow answer the questions:\n\n> What is the job of the person who is pakistani?\n\n→ Pakistani is in position 2 → job is freelancer\n\n> What is the movie genre of the person who is pakistani?\n\n→ Pakistani is in position 2 → movie genre is animation\n\n> What movie genre does the person in position 1 watch?\n\n→ Position 1: thriller\n\n> At what position is the person who is a videographer?\n\n→ Position 1\n\nSo answers in order:\n\n1. freelancer  \n2. animation  \n3. thriller  \n4. 1\n\nFinal answer format: <solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.12692900002002716}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.023355737328529358}, {"token": " given", "logprob": -0.3868725597858429}, {"token": ":\n\n", "logprob": -0.14301663637161255}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -0.001994288759306073}, {"token": " Two", "logprob": -0.12748512625694275}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -7.70062324590981e-05}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0029937471263110638}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.00867254938930273}, {"toke